dengjen-tashkeel-capi provides a plain C shared library and header, not a CMake
package -- link against it directly:

    find_library(DENGJEN_TASHKEEL_CAPI_LIB dengjen_tashkeel_capi)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ${DENGJEN_TASHKEEL_CAPI_LIB})

The header is installed as <dengjen_tashkeel.h> on the standard include path.
See https://github.com/ZirekHQ/dengjen-tashkeel/blob/main/crates/capi/ffi_usage_example.py
for the API's shape (the same C entry points, called there from Python via ctypes).
